    "description": "Objective\n\nStandardise the Sign-Up Console list views and the columns Reps see in every one of them.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Every list view uses the column order: Player Name, Operator, Time Since Sign Up, ... , Status (last, with icons where possible)\n\n* Pre-made list views:\n\n* All\n\n* Archived -> Status = Archived\n\n* New -> Status = New\n\n* Queue -> Status = In Progress\n\n* Overdue -> Past Due = True AND Status = In Progress\n\n* Flagged -> Status = Flagged\n\n* Fraudulent Sign Ups -> Status = Flagged AND Fraud Flag = True\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* All seven views exist with the standard column set\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nRevised by BUILD-48 (Doc #35) once Flagged was removed from the status model, and by BUILD-37 (Doc #14) which adds the owner-only filter before go-live.\n\nSupersedes POC-21, which proposed an overlapping and now-outdated list view set.\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 12.",
